<title>HONG KONG: Int'l Bank of Asia 1996 net up 18.06 pct.</title>
<headline>Int'l Bank of Asia 1996 net up 18.06 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   55.81  vs  48.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    14.0   vs  12.6</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    362.84 vs  307.34</p>
<p>    Company name		 International Bank of Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 14-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 25</p>
<p>NOTE - International Bank of Asia provides a wide range of banking and financial services including retail and corporate banking, hire purchase and leasing, and credit card operations.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 21.2 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 7.2 cents) vs 18.9 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
